Subject: [PATCH] ProofScope v1.1: dependent-structure linking, compositional
 soundness, minimality

- Composition.lean: 15 theorems (14 axiom-free, 1 propext): linking transport,
  same-text-different-structure, polarity sign rule, strict_lift_iff
  (strictness survives a monotone context iff k True and not k False),
  exists/empty-binder absorption counterexamples, inclusion_minimal,
  redundant_drop, substitutable_example
- AssumptionExtract11.lean + adelta11.py: clean binder names, instance binders
  re-declared as instances, instance witnesses from carrier operations,
  pp.analyze round-trip; minimality mode (NECESSARY/REDUNDANT/UNNEEDED,
  jointly necessary pairs); CONCLUSION_ONLY_CHANGE
- Root cause of Mathlib m04/m05 (hygienic instance names) reproduced in core
  Lean and fixed; Mathlib rerun PENDING
- Block-1 frozen run 16/18, 0 hostile violations; block 2 34/36 (dev)
- Pre-registered competitor scoring protocol and SemantEq exporter

